Description: Non-locking visual screensaver for KDE Plasma Wayland
 Plasma Visual Screensaver provides configurable low-resource animations,
 OLED-friendly backgrounds, a moving clock, multi-monitor support, and
 automatic idle activation on KDE Plasma Wayland.
 .
 This application is a decorative overlay, not a screen locker or security
 boundary.
